#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "RS_MysteryEventsHouse_Text_OldManGreeting"
msgid ""
"When I was young, I traveled the world\n"
"as a POKéMON TRAINER.\p"
"Now that I've become an old buzzard,\n"
"my only amusement is watching young\l"
"TRAINERS battle.$"
msgstr ""
"我年轻的时候，\n"
"作为宝可梦训练家周游过世界。\p"
"现在我已经老了，唯一的乐趣\n"
"就是看年轻的训练家们对战。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F/scripts.inc:48
msgctxt "RS_MysteryEventsHouse_Text_DoorIsLocked"
msgid "The door appears to be locked.$"
msgstr "门好像锁上了。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F/scripts.inc:51
msgctxt "RS_MysteryEventsHouse_Text_ChallengeVisitingTrainer"
msgid ""
"A TRAINER named {STR_VAR_1} is\n"
"visiting my home.\p"
"Would you like to challenge\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}?$"
msgstr ""
"一位叫{STR_VAR_1}的训练家\n"
"正在我家做客。\p"
"你要向{STR_VAR_1}\n"
"发起挑战吗？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F/scripts.inc:57
msgctxt "RS_MysteryEventsHouse_Text_YouWontBattle"
msgid ""
"You won't battle? I'm disappointed\n"
"that I can't see you battle…$"
msgstr ""
"你不对战吗？\n"
"看不到你对战，真是遗憾……$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F/scripts.inc:61
msgctxt "RS_MysteryEventsHouse_Text_KeepItToA3On3"
msgid ""
"Oh, good, good!\p"
"But my house isn't all that sturdy.\p"
"Could I ask you to keep it down to\n"
"a 3-on-3 match?$"
msgstr ""
"哦，好，好！\p"
"不过我的房子不太结实。\p"
"能请你们只进行\n"
"3对3的对战吗？$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F/scripts.inc:67
msgctxt "RS_MysteryEventsHouse_Text_SaveYourProgress"
msgid ""
"Before you two battle, you should\n"
"save your progress.$"
msgstr ""
"在你们两个对战之前，\n"
"最好先记录一下进度。$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F/scripts.inc:71
msgctxt "RS_MysteryEventsHouse_Text_HopeToSeeAGoodMatch"
msgid "I hope to see a good match!$"
msgstr "希望能看到一场精彩的对战！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F/scripts.inc:74
msgctxt "RS_MysteryEventsHouse_Text_BattleTie"
msgid ""
"So, it became a standoff.\p"
"It was a brilliant match in which\n"
"neither side conceded a step!$"
msgstr ""
"结果是平手啊。\p"
"真是一场双方\n"
"寸步不让的精彩对战！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F/scripts.inc:79
msgctxt "RS_MysteryEventsHouse_Text_BattleWon"
msgid ""
"That was superlative!\p"
"Why, it was like seeing myself in\n"
"my youth again!$"
msgstr ""
"太精彩了！\p"
"哎呀，就像又看到了\n"
"年轻时的自己一样！$"

#: data/maps/MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F/scripts.inc:84
msgctxt "RS_MysteryEventsHouse_Text_BattleLost"
msgid ""
"Ah, too bad for you!\p"
"But it was a good match.\n"
"I hope you can win next time.$"
msgstr ""
"啊，真可惜！\p"
"不过这是一场精彩的对战。\n"
"希望你下次能赢。$"
